     * [`DspiError::Disconnected`]. Waits for a notification read in
     * progress (at most its timeout). Idempotent. (Not `close`: UniFFI's
     * Kotlin objects already have `AutoCloseable.close()`.)
     */
    func shutdown() 
    
}
